<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="A2.T6.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
